<title>SWEDEN: S&amp;P hopes to comment on Swedish bank merger Tuesday.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P hopes to comment on Swedish bank merger Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. credit ratings agency Standard &amp; Poor's (S&amp;P) said on Tuesday that it hoped to comment on the announced merger between Swedbank and Foreningsbanken later in the day.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope that we will be able to make a statement during the day,&quot; said Marianne Flink, head of European ratings for S&amp;P in Stockholm.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
